# Local-only files that must never reach a Vercel build.
#
# `.env.local` is the important one: Next loads it during the build and it
# takes precedence over the environment Vercel injects, so uploading it points
# a production build at whatever is in a developer's local file.
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Build caches — regenerated on Vercel, and a half-written .vercel/output can
# be misread as a prebuilt deployment.
.next
.vercel/output
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Local tooling noise.
.playwright-mcp
*.png.bak
